<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow">
  <title>Zanoma · Nucleus · Sample Brief</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0a0d10;
      --panel: #11161b;
      --panel-2: #161c22;
      --line: #1f262d;
      --ink: #e8edf2;
      --muted: #8a98a6;
      --dim: #566370;
      --green: #9bff5e;
      --green-soft: #7ed957;
      --orange: #ffb454;
      --slack-bg: #1a1d21;
      --slack-text: #d1d2d3;
      --slack-channel: #9b9c9e;
      --email-bg: #ffffff;
      --email-text: #202124;
      --email-muted: #5f6368;
      --email-line: #dadce0;
      --sms-bg: #000000;
      --sms-bubble: #1e1e1e;
      --sms-blue: #0a7aff;
      --sms-green: #34c759;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    html, body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    a { color: inherit; }

    .strip {
      background: #0d1217;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 8px 24px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 18px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .strip .badge {
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid var(--green);
      color: var(--green);
      padding: 3px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }

    .strip strong { color: #cfd6dd; }

    .header {
      padding: 32px 24px 16px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--green);
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', monospace;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .h1 {
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 36px;
      line-height: 1.1;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      margin: 0 auto;
      max-width: 900px;
    }

    .sub {
      color: var(--muted);
      margin: 14px auto 0;
      max-width: 640px;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .toggle-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 24px 0 8px;
    }

    .toggle {
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      color: var(--muted);
      padding: 10px 20px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font: inherit;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: all 0.15s;
    }

    .toggle:hover {
      color: var(--ink);
      border-color: #2c3641;
    }

    .toggle.active {
      background: var(--green);
      color: #0a0d10;
      border-color: var(--green);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .stage {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 24px 16px 64px;
    }

    .frame {
      display: none;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 720px;
    }

    .frame.active {
      display: block;
    }

    /* === SLACK FRAME === */
    .slack {
      background: var(--slack-bg);
      border-radius: 8px;
      color: var(--slack-text);
      font-family: 'Slack-Lato', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      border: 1px solid #2c2d30;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .slack-titlebar {
      background: #19171d;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #2c2d30;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .slack-titlebar .ws {
      opacity: 0.6;
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    .slack-channel {
      padding: 12px 18px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #2c2d30;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .slack-msg {
      padding: 18px 18px 6px;
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .slack-avatar {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #9bff5e, #34c759);
      color: #0a0d10;
      font-weight: 800;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .slack-body {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .slack-meta {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #fff;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .slack-meta strong {
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .slack-meta .bot {
      background: #616061;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 10px;
      padding: 1px 6px;
      border-radius: 3px;
      margin-left: 4px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .slack-meta .ts {
      color: var(--slack-channel);
      margin-left: 6px;
      font-weight: 400;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .slack-content {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .slack-h {
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #fff;
      margin: 14px 0 6px;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .slack-h:first-child {
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .slack-list {
      margin: 6px 0 14px;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .slack-list li {
      padding: 3px 0;
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .slack-list li::before {
      content: '•';
      color: var(--slack-channel);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .slack-divider {
      border: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid #383a3e;
      margin: 18px 0;
    }

    .slack-score {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 6px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      border-bottom: 1px dotted #2c2d30;
    }

    .slack-score:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    .slack-score .name {
      color: #fff;
    }

    .slack-score .num {
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .slack-score .delta-up {
      color: var(--green-soft);
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-left: 6px;
    }

    .slack-score .delta-down {
      color: #e01e5a;
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-left: 6px;
    }

    .slack-score .delta-flat {
      color: var(--slack-channel);
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-left: 6px;
    }

    .slack-status {
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      background: #1d2024;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--slack-channel);
    }

    .slack-reactions {
      margin-top: 8px;
      padding-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .slack-reaction {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #222529;
      border: 1px solid #383a3e;
      color: var(--slack-text);
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 11px;
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-right: 4px;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    /* === EMAIL FRAME === */
    .email {
      background: var(--email-bg);
      color: var(--email-text);
      font-family: 'Google Sans', 'Roboto', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--email-line);
      box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    }

    .email-titlebar {
      background: #f6f8fa;
      padding: 10px 18px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--email-line);
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--email-muted);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .email-titlebar .gmail {
      color: #ea4335;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .email-subject {
      padding: 18px 28px 6px;
      font-size: 22px;
      color: var(--email-text);
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .email-meta {
      padding: 0 28px 14px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--email-line);
    }

    .email-avatar {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #9bff5e;
      color: #0a0d10;
      font-weight: 800;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .email-from {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .email-from .name {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--email-text);
    }

    .email-from .addr {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--email-muted);
    }

    .email-from .to {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--email-muted);
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    .email-time {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--email-muted);
    }

    .email-body {
      padding: 24px 28px;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--email-text);
    }

    .email-body p {
      margin: 0 0 14px;
    }

    .email-h {
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #0d1217;
      font-size: 16px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin: 24px 0 10px;
      padding-bottom: 6px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #0d1217;
    }

    .email-h:first-child {
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .email-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .email-table td {
      padding: 8px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--email-line);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .email-table .num {
      text-align: right;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .email-table .delta-up {
      color: #1e8e3e;
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-left: 6px;
    }

    .email-table .delta-down {
      color: #d93025;
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-left: 6px;
    }

    .email-table .delta-flat {
      color: var(--email-muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-left: 6px;
    }

    .email-status {
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      background: #e8f0fe;
      color: #1967d2;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    /* === SMS FRAME === */
    .sms {
      background: var(--sms-bg);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 24px 20px;
      color: #fff;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      max-width: 380px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .sms-titlebar {
      text-align: center;
      padding-bottom: 14px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #1c1c1e;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #999;
    }

    .sms-titlebar .from {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 15px;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 2px;
    }

    .sms-thread {
      padding: 14px 0;
    }

    .sms-day {
      text-align: center;
      color: #666;
      font-size: 11px;
      margin: 18px 0 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    }

    .sms-bubble {
      background: var(--sms-bubble);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 9px 13px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      display: inline-block;
      max-width: 85%;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.4;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .sms-bubble.sent {
      background: var(--sms-green);
      color: #000;
      border-radius: 18px;
      float: right;
      clear: both;
      margin-right: 0;
      margin-left: auto;
    }

    .sms-time {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 10px;
      color: #666;
      margin: 8px 0;
      clear: both;
    }

    .sms-h {
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 6px 0 2px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="strip">
    <span><strong>Nucleus Demo</strong> — Acme HVAC, Bend OR</span>
    <span class="badge">LIVE</span>
  </div>

  <div class="header">
    <div class="eyebrow">ZANOMA · NUCLEUS</div>
    <h1 class="h1">One Daily Brief. Three Delivery Channels.</h1>
    <p class="sub">Same intelligence engine. Rendered for Slack, email, or SMS. Toggle between frames to see the same brief adapted for each channel.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="toggle-row">
    <button class="toggle active" onclick="showFrame('slack')">📘 Slack</button>
    <button class="toggle" onclick="showFrame('email')">📧 Email</button>
    <button class="toggle" onclick="showFrame('sms')">💬 SMS</button>
  </div>

  <div class="stage">
    <!-- SLACK FRAME -->
    <div class="frame active" id="frame-slack">
      <div class="slack">
        <div class="slack-titlebar">
          <span>💼 <span class="ws">Zanoma Workspace</span> · Daily Brief</span>
        </div>
        <div class="slack-channel"># daily-brief</div>
        <div class="slack-msg">
          <div class="slack-avatar">Z</div>
          <div class="slack-body">
            <div class="slack-meta">
              <strong>Zanoma</strong>
              <span class="bot">BOT</span>
              <span class="ts">9:00 AM</span>
            </div>
            <div class="slack-content">
              <strong class="slack-h">Tuesday, April 28 — Your Daily Brief</strong>

              <strong class="slack-h">☀️ Acquisition: +18%</strong>
              <p>Lead form speed dropped to 4.1s on mobile yesterday. We caught it. Web team has been flagged.</p>
              <div class="slack-score">
                <span class="name">Metric</span>
                <span><span class="num">+18%</span><span class="delta-up">↑ up</span></span>
              </div>

              <strong class="slack-h">⭐ Reputation: 4.7★</strong>
              <p>Sarah J. left a 5-star review this morning: "Best HVAC service I've had in 20 years in Bend." Excellent signal.</p>
              <div class="slack-score">
                <span class="name">Rating</span>
                <span><span class="num">4.7★</span><span class="delta-flat">— flat</span></span>
              </div>

              <strong class="slack-h">💰 Finance</strong>
              <p>Margin holding. AC compressor reorder cycle on schedule. No surprises.</p>

              <hr class="slack-divider">

              <strong class="slack-h">Your move</strong>
              <p><strong>Approve the David K. callback first</strong> when you sit down — highest-value lead this month ($12–18K).</p>

              <div class="slack-status">✓ Brief generated at 9:00 AM PT</div>
              <div class="slack-reactions">
                <span class="slack-reaction">👍 3</span>
                <span class="slack-reaction">🙏 1</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- EMAIL FRAME -->
    <div class="frame" id="frame-email">
      <div class="email">
        <div class="email-titlebar">
          <span class="gmail">Gmail</span>
          <span>— Inbox</span>
        </div>
        <div class="email-subject">Your Daily Brief — April 28, 2026</div>
        <div class="email-meta">
          <div class="email-avatar">Z</div>
          <div class="email-from">
            <div class="name">Zanoma</div>
            <div class="addr">brief@zanoma.com</div>
            <div class="to">to Marcus Thompson</div>
          </div>
          <div class="email-time">9:00 AM</div>
        </div>
        <div class="email-body">
          <p>Good morning, Marcus.</p>

          <h2 class="email-h">☀️ Acquisition</h2>
          <table class="email-table">
            <tr>
              <td>Lead form speed</td>
              <td class="num">4.1s<span class="delta-down">↑ slow</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Target</td>
              <td class="num">&lt;2s</td>
            </tr>
          </table>
          <p>Web team flagged. Retest daily.</p>

          <h2 class="email-h">⭐ Reputation</h2>
          <table class="email-table">
            <tr>
              <td>Rating</td>
              <td class="num">4.7★<span class="delta-flat">—</span></td>
            </tr>
          </table>
          <p>Sarah J. 5-star: "Best HVAC service I've had in 20 years in Bend." Returning customer (daughter of 2024 client).</p>

          <h2 class="email-h">💰 Finance</h2>
          <p>Margin holding. AC compressor reorder on schedule. P&amp;L impact minimal. Revisit May 5.</p>

          <h2 class="email-h">Your Move</h2>
          <p><strong>Approve David K. callback first.</strong> Highest-value lead ($12–18K). Pipeline humming.</p>

          <div class="email-status">✓ Brief generated at 9:00 AM PT</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- SMS FRAME -->
    <div class="frame" id="frame-sms">
      <div class="sms">
        <div class="sms-titlebar">
          <span class="from">Zanoma</span>
          <span>Today 9:00 AM</span>
        </div>
        <div class="sms-thread">
          <div class="sms-day">Tuesday</div>

          <div class="sms-bubble">
            <strong class="sms-h">☀️ Acquisition +18%</strong><br>
            Lead form speed: 4.1s (target &lt;2s). Web team flagged.
          </div>

          <div class="sms-bubble">
            <strong class="sms-h">⭐ Reputation 4.7★</strong><br>
            Sarah J. 5-star: "Best HVAC service I've had in 20 years in Bend"
          </div>

          <div class="sms-bubble">
            <strong class="sms-h">💰 Finance</strong><br>
            Margin holding. AC reorder on schedule.
          </div>

          <div class="sms-time">9:02 AM</div>

          <div class="sms-bubble">
            <strong class="sms-h">👉 Action:</strong> Approve David K. callback first. Highest-value lead this month. 💪
          </div>

          <div class="sms-time">9:05 AM</div>

          <div class="sms-bubble sent">Got it. Calling David now.</div>

          <div class="sms-bubble">✓ Noted. Tracking the callback outcome for your 4 PM brief.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    function showFrame(frameName) {
      document.querySelectorAll('.frame').forEach(f => f.classList.remove('active'));
      document.querySelectorAll('.toggle').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));
      document.getElementById('frame-' + frameName).classList.add('active');
      event.target.classList.add('active');
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
